{"id":"n82391-3-7","stage":5,"title":"튀다 · 溜走","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n82391-3-7-1","ko":"가게에 도둑이 들었다고요?","zh":"店里进小偷了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가게에","meaning":"店，店铺，商店","explanation":"가게：店，店铺，商店；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"가게","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17287","senseId":"1","lemma":"가게","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도둑이","meaning":"小偷，盗贼，窃贼","explanation":"도둑：小偷，盗贼，窃贼；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"도둑","audio":"/audio/9eaab0702752d6341042.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47813","senseId":"2","lemma":"도둑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었다고요?","meaning":"照射进来，涨，起","explanation":"들다：照射进来，涨，起；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다고요：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"2","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c013538e549a4ded","term":"가게","zh":"店，店铺，商店","audio":"/audio/c013538e549a4dedbd4a.mp3","entryId":"17287","definition":"铺放着东西来售卖的小规模铺子。","pronunciation":["가ː게"]},{"id":"9eaab0702752d634","term":"도둑","zh":"小偷，盗贼，窃贼","audio":"/audio/9eaab0702752d6341042.mp3","entryId":"47813","definition":"窃取或抢夺别人的东西的人。","pronunciation":["도둑"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"照射进来，涨，起","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"光、水等进到里面。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/121b1605334a17efd556.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n82391-3-7-2","ko":"네, 방금 저쪽 골목으로 튀었어요. 꼭 좀 잡아 주세요.","zh":"是的，他刚往那边的胡同里逃走了。请一定要抓住他。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"방금","meaning":"刚才，方才","explanation":"방금：刚才，方才","readings":[{"term":"방금","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"92065","senseId":"1","lemma":"방금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"저쪽","meaning":"那；边","explanation":"저：那；쪽：边","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"},{"term":"쪽","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71215","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"58147","senseId":"1","lemma":"쪽","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"골목으로","meaning":"巷子，胡同","explanation":"골목：巷子，胡同；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"골목","audio":"/audio/587e6d0cbedaf25ab43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18338","senseId":"1","lemma":"골목","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"튀었어요.","meaning":"溜走，逃跑，逃走，逃亡","explanation":"튀다：溜走，逃跑，逃走，逃亡；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"튀다","audio":"/audio/1e864f31429430eb1370.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"82391","senseId":"3","lemma":"튀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잡아","meaning":"抓，捕","explanation":"잡다：抓，捕；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"잡다","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70378","senseId":"2","lemma":"잡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"2fd9e7d411752b46","term":"방금","zh":"刚才，方才","audio":"/audio/2fd9e7d411752b4601d9.mp3","entryId":"92065","definition":"比说话时刻稍微早一点的时间。","pronunciation":["방금"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"那","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"71215","definition":"用于指示与话者、听者离得很远的对象。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"077b6c57af048c3b","term":"쪽","zh":"边","audio":"/audio/077b6c57af048c3baee6.mp3","entryId":"58147","definition":"进行或朝向的方向。","pronunciation":["쪽"]},{"id":"587e6d0cbedaf25a","term":"골목","zh":"巷子，胡同","audio":"/audio/587e6d0cbedaf25ab43f.mp3","entryId":"18338","definition":"两边有房屋的长而窄的街道。","pronunciation":["골ː목"]},{"id":"1e864f31429430eb","term":"튀다","zh":"溜走，逃跑，逃走，逃亡","audio":"/audio/1e864f31429430eb1370.mp3","entryId":"82391","definition":"(粗俗)逃掉。","pronunciation":["튀다"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"b8cc8df3de72c173","term":"잡다","zh":"抓，捕","audio":"/audio/b8cc8df3de72c173aa21.mp3","entryId":"70378","definition":"捉住放在手里。","pronunciation":["잡따"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e3309ccf356d3e0ffbfd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.629,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=82391","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"고급","day":152,"sequenceScore":3.0043,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0